\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.markLinear\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">markLinear</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Marks `a` as linear, a debugging aid: if a marked array is ever copied because it is shared when\nit needs to be exclusive, as before an in-place write, the runtime panics. The mark goes on an\nexclusive array, so if `a` is shared it is copied first and the copy is marked. Logically this is\nthe identity.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.markLinear","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.markLinear","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Float32/Array.lean#L90-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.extract\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">extract</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">start </span><span class=\"fn\">stop</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The elements of `a` from index `start` up to, but not including, `min stop a.size`, copied into a\nnew array.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.extract","kind":"def","line":80,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.extract","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Float32/Array.lean#L80-L86"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.popWhile\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">popWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array\">Float32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Removes the longest run of elements at the end of `a` that satisfy `p`, in place when `a` is not\nshared.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.popWhile","kind":"def","line":64,"name":"ScalarArray.Float32Array.popWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Float32/Array.lean#L64-L70"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float32/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float32Array.back\"><span class=\"name\